  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;det avser den fem&#xE5;riga strategiska planen f&#xF6;r The Aids Support Organisation under perioden 2003 - 2007. St&#xF6;det &#xE4;r ett generellt st&#xF6;d till organisationens verksamhet och &#xE4;r en del av det svenska st&#xF6;det till Uganda h&#xE4;lsobudget.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support is to the five years Strategic Plan for The Aids Support Organisation for the period 2003 - 2007. The support is a core support to TASO and is part of the Health Budget Support from Sweden.</narrative>
  </description>
